realized the case could be so much more than it is now. So we're taking a little extra time to make it right:• New twists• New characters and new evidence to investigate• Additional digital content, including audio recordings and videos•","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:43:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041562","verified_at":"2026-10-25T14:53:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4684120-1846651706695693","game_id":"steam-4684120","kind":"announcement","title":"The case reopens on October 29.","summary":"The case reopens on October 29. Rainier Falls, April 2005. The police have closed the file: suicide. But the evidence doesn't add up and you're the only one still looking. It Was Not a Suicide launches on October 29. Thank you to everyone who played the demo, sent feedback, and helped us shape the full release. What awaits you in the full gameThe complete investigation the demo only opened the file. Now you can follow every lead to the end. POISON-OS dig through the retro terminal, case document","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:17:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695693","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4684120-1846651706688016","game_id":"steam-4684120","kind":"update","title":"Update Notes – Thank You for Your Feedback!","summary":"Hi detectives, Thank you all for playing It Was Not A Suicide Demo and sharing your thoughts with us. Many of the changes in this update come directly from your feedback, so please keep it coming! Improvements & FixesGraphics settings on first launch: Fixed an issue where graphics and resolution settings defaulted to the lowest options when launching the game for the first time. Notes cursor: Added a visible text cursor to the notes, so you can always see which line you're writing on. ESC to go ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:05:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688016","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4684120-1846651706674215","game_id":"steam-4684120","kind":"announcement","title":"The It Was Not a Suicide Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The investigation has begun. The It Was Not a Suicide Demo is now live on Steam and completely free to play! Rainier Falls, April 2005. Adele's death was officially ruled a suicide, but the files on your desk tell a different story. Now it's your turn to find out what really happened. Inside the demoRead every word: Go through police reports, autopsy documents, interrogation transcripts and suspects' journals to find the contradictions. Go retro: Boot up the POISON-OS terminal to access confiden","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:57:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674215","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4684120-1846018067943607","game_id":"steam-4684120","kind":"announcement","title":"The It Was Not a Suicide Demo Is Out October 14!","summary":"April 2005. It never stops raining in Rainier Falls. Adele's death was officially recorded as a suicide. But the case files don't add up. The It Was Not a Suicide Demo arrives on Steam on October 14, and it's completely free. It's your first chance to step into the investigation and see whether you can see through the lies. What you'll do in the demoRead between the lines: Go through police reports, autopsy documents, interrogation transcripts and suspects' journals word by word. Hack into the p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T10:29:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4684120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4684120":"2026-10-26T13:36:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4684120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:57Z"},"5096130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:36:58Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4684120","app_id":4684120,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:47Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"9be5cdfbc29a4dffdbcc020cff3d9d2f15b4f4dadd332e1c908bf75655a4b8f9","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"2005년 레이니어 폴스를 배경으로 한 심리 공포 추리 시뮬레이션. 사건 파일 속 모순을 찾아 Adele의 죽음에 숨겨진 진실을 밝혀내세요. 단 한 번의 기회로 용의자들의 거짓말을 간파할 만큼 뛰어난 탐정인가요? 체포할 기회는 단 한 번뿐입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Poisonic Studio","creator_clan_account_id":45402179}],"developers":[{"name":"Poisonic Studio","creator_clan_account_id":45402179}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"IWNS Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/app